<!-- 首页：布局照搬网页版手机布局（标题栏、地图、底部三个按钮、卡片、两个抽屉） -->
<view class="app">
  <canvas type="2d" id="map" class="map" disable-scroll="true"
    bindtouchstart="onTouchStart" bindtouchmove="onTouchMove" bindtouchend="onTouchEnd" bindtouchcancel="onTouchEnd"></canvas>

  <!-- 标题栏（放在微信胶囊按钮左边） -->
  <view class="float panel brandbar" style="top:{{nav.top}}px;right:{{nav.right}}px;min-height:{{nav.h}}px">
    <text class="h1">{{T.title}}</text>
    <view class="langs">
      <view class="lb {{lang === 'en' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-l="en" bindtap="setLang">EN</view>
      <view class="lb {{lang === 'zh' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-l="zh" bindtap="setLang">中文</view>
    </view>
    <view class="infobtn" bindtap="toggleInfo">i</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{info}}" class="float panel infopop" style="top:{{nav.top + nav.h + 8}}px"><text>{{T.info}}</text></view>

  <!-- 缩放 -->
  <view class="float zoom">
    <view class="zb {{canZoomIn ? '' : 'off'}}" bindtap="zoomIn">+</view>
    <view class="zb {{canZoomOut ? '' : 'off'}}" bindtap="zoomOut">−</view>
    <view class="zb fit {{canZoomOut ? '' : 'off'}}" bindtap="zoomFit">{{T.zfit}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 底部三个按钮 -->
  <view class="mbar">
    <view class="mb match" bindtap="openMatch">{{T.matchBtn}}</view>
    <view class="mb" data-s="controls" bindtap="openSheet">{{T.filters}}</view>
    <view class="mb" data-s="homes" bindtap="openSheet">{{homesCount}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 公寓 / 地点卡片 -->
  <view wx:if="{{card}}" class="card {{expanded ? 'sheet' : 'compact'}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="x" bindtap="closeCard">×</view>
    <view class="tag" style="background:{{card.place ? card.tagColor : '#2c5c8a'}}">{{card.tag}}</view>
    <view class="h3">{{card.name}}</view>
    <block wx:if="{{card.place}}"><view class="txt">{{card.text}}</view></block>
    <block wx:else>
      <block wx:if="{{!expanded}}">
        <view class="compact-facts"><text class="strong">{{card.price}}</text><text>{{card.walk}}</text></view>
        <view class="compact-note">{{T.compactNote || ''}}</view>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="addr">{{card.addr}}</view>
        <view class="txt">{{card.text}}</view>
        <view class="walks"><text wx:for="{{card.walks}}" wx:key="index" class="wk">{{item}}</text></view>
        <view class="facts"><view wx:for="{{card.facts}}" wx:key="index" wx:for-item="f" class="fact"><text wx:for="{{f}}" wx:key="index" wx:for-item="p" class="{{p.b ? 'b' : ''}}">{{p.t}}</text></view></view>
        <view class="actions2">
          <view class="ha {{card.fav ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleFav">{{card.fav ? '★ ' + T.saved : '☆ ' + T.save}}</view>
          <button class="ha" open-type="share">{{T.share}}</button>
        </view>
        <view class="src">{{card.src}}</view>
      </block>
      <view class="acts">
        <view class="cta" bindtap="ask">{{expanded ? T.ask : T.compactAsk}}</view>
        <view class="detail-toggle" bindtap="toggleExpand">{{expanded ? T.collapseDetails : T.expandDetails}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{expanded}}" class="cmpb {{card.cmp ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleCompare">{{card.cmp ? T.cmpAdded : T.cmpAdd}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <!-- 抽屉：公寓列表 -->
  <view class="sheet-mask" wx:if="{{sheet}}" bindtap="closeSheets"></view>
  <view class="panel drawer homes {{sheet === 'homes' ? 'open' : ''}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="phead"><text class="h2">{{T.homesBtn}}</text><view class="pbtn" bindtap="closeSheets">{{T.close}}</view></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="pbody" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
      <view class="home-search">
        <text class="lbl">{{T.h_search}}</text>
        <input class="search" type="text" placeholder="{{T.h_placeholder}}" value="{{filters.query}}" bindinput="onSearch" confirm-type="search"></input>
        <view class="home-search-row"><text>{{countText}}</text><view class="sbtn {{filters.favoritesOnly ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleFavOnly">{{T.h_favorites}}</view></view>
        <text class="local-note">{{T.h_local}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="pc-sort">
        <text class="flbl">{{T.rankBy}}</text>
        <view class="fsel {{isRanked ? 'ranked' : ''}}" data-k="rank" bindtap="openSelect"><text>{{options.rank.current}}</text><text class="caret">⌄</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{open === 'rank'}}" class="fs-list">
          <view wx:for="{{options.rank}}" wx:key="v" class="fs-opt {{item.on ? 'on' : ''}}" data-k="rank" data-v="{{item.v}}" bindtap="pick">{{item.label}}</view>
        </view>
        <text wx:if="{{sortNote}}" class="pc-sortnote">{{sortNote}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="stable-note">{{T.h_stable}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{!count}}" class="empty-homes"><text>{{T.h_empty}}</text><view class="pbtn" bindtap="resetFilters">{{T.h_reset}}</view></view>
      <block wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="title" wx:for-item="g">
        <view class="gh">{{g.title}}</view>
        <view wx:for="{{g.items}}" wx:key="id" class="hrow">
          <view class="hbtn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openHome"><text class="n">{{item.n}}</text><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text></view>
          <view class="fav-mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleFav">{{item.fav ? '★' : '☆'}}</view>
          <view class="cbtn {{item.cmp ? 'on' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleCompare">{{item.cmp ? '✓' : '+'}}</view>
        </view>
      </block>
      <view wx:for="{{ranked}}" wx:key="id" class="hrow {{isRanked ? 'r' : ''}}">
        <text wx:if="{{isRanked}}" class="rk {{item.rank <= 3 ? 'top' : ''}}">{{item.rank}}</text>
        <view class="hbtn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openHome"><text class="n">{{item.n}}</text><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text><text class="w">{{item.w}}</text></view>
        <view class="fav-mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleFav">{{item.fav ? '★' : '☆'}}</view>
        <view class="cbtn {{item.cmp ? 'on' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleCompare">{{item.cmp ? '✓' : '+'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pad-bottom"></view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <!-- 抽屉：找公寓（筛选） -->
  <view class="panel drawer controls {{sheet === 'controls' ? 'open' : ''}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="phead"><text class="h2">{{T.findHome}}</text><view class="pbtn" bindtap="closeSheets">{{T.close}}</view></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="pbody" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
      <view class="filter-grid">
        <view class="field" wx:for="{{['budget', 'room', 'destination', 'walk']}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="k">
          <text class="flbl small">{{T['h_' + k]}}</text>
          <view class="fsel" data-k="{{k}}" bindtap="openSelect"><text>{{options[k].current}}</text><text class="caret">⌄</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{open === k}}" class="fs-list">
            <view wx:for="{{options[k]}}" wx:key="v" wx:for-item="o" class="fs-opt {{o.on ? 'on' : ''}}" data-k="{{k}}" data-v="{{o.v}}" bindtap="pick">{{o.label}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text class="filter-note">{{T.h_note}}</text>
      <view class="filter-footer"><view class="fbtn" bindtap="resetFilters">{{T.h_reset}}</view><view class="fbtn main" bindtap="viewResults">{{viewText}}</view></view>
      <view class="toggles">
        <view wx:for="{{layers}}" wx:key="k" class="chip {{item.on ? '' : 'off'}}" data-k="{{item.k}}" bindtap="toggleLayer"><text class="sw" style="background:{{item.color}}"></text><text>{{item.label}}</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="zonekey"><view wx:for="{{zones}}" wx:key="k"><text class="zi" style="background:{{item.color}}"></text>{{item.label}}</view></view>
      <view class="pad-bottom"></view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
</view>
